I'm so glad you're okay.

00:00:32.549 --> 00:00:33.549
Jimmy.

00:00:33.549 --> 00:00:36.340
Yes.

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:43.509
I've been holding on to a life on this farm that hasn't existed for years.

00:00:43.509 --> 00:00:45.509
