Thank God you hurt me.

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:20.990
Me.

00:06:20.990 --> 00:06:21.990
Look at me?

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:22.990
Well, I bet.

00:06:22.990 --> 00:06:24.990
Apart for breathing in all that smoke, you're gonna be okay.

00:06:24.990 --> 00:06:26.990
We should still get you to Met General just to be sure.

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:27.990
Think you can make it to my rig?

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:34.079
Uh...

00:06:34.079 --> 00:06:35.079
Chloe.

00:06:35.079 --> 00:06:38.079
You can make a good wing man, Chloe, her wing person.

00:06:38.079 --> 00:06:41.060
Thank you for your help.

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:43.060
All straight by the hospital, huh?

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:45.060
You're gonna be okay?

00:06:45.060 --> 00:06:46.060
Yeah.

00:06:46.060 --> 00:06:48.060
Excuse me, man, let's take a little?

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:49.060
Yeah.

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:51.060
It was a woman with red hair.

00:06:51.060 --> 00:06:53.060
I helped her get out of the bus and the paramedics took her.

00:06:53.060 --> 00:06:54.060
Do you know if she's all right?

00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:56.060
A lot of people I've been coming in and out,

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:57.060
but the most seriously injured,

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:58.060
at the hospital.

00:06:58.060 --> 00:06:59.060
It's your trailer.

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:00.060
