00:11:04.610 --> 00:11:10.779
The Lex Luthor that I knew disappeared years ago.

00:11:10.779 --> 00:11:12.779
It's been a long time since we were friends.

00:11:12.779 --> 00:11:16.500
I don't know what happened to him.

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:20.000
Fair enough.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:24.309
But if you do think of something, please give me a call.

00:11:24.309 --> 00:11:26.309
And Clark.

00:11:26.309 --> 00:11:29.820
You were extraordinary out there.

00:11:29.820 --> 00:11:33.259
Thank you for saving my life.

00:11:33.259 --> 00:11:45.129
