00:11:45.129 --> 00:11:48.129
I'd hate to see the same thing happen to yours.

00:11:48.129 --> 00:12:00.330
Handsome.

00:12:00.330 --> 00:12:01.330
And a liar.

00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:03.330
He's hiding something.

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:05.330
I'll have someone watch him.

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:34.960
No. I'll keep an eye on this one personally.

00:12:34.960 --> 00:12:38.960
Docs is I'm okay, but I feel like I just threw down with a cardinal quo.

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:43.960
Well, I figured you'd be hungry, so unfortunately it's meatloaf Mondays, but I did score you some curly fries.

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:46.960
Are you kidding? Hot foods get any day of the week.

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:47.960
Thanks.

00:12:47.960 --> 00:12:50.960
I, uh, I'm surprised your parents aren't here.

