Here.

00:12:54.139 --> 00:12:56.139
Looked really cool what you did for me and everything,

00:12:56.139 --> 00:12:59.139
but it doesn't mean I have to tell you my life story.

00:12:59.139 --> 00:13:01.139
I wasn't asking.

00:13:01.139 --> 00:13:05.440
I haven't seen them in years.

00:13:05.440 --> 00:13:08.440
I'm kind of in between homes right now.

00:13:08.440 --> 00:13:22.169
You know, why don't I grab you with soda to wash that, Dad?

