Hey.

00:13:23.169 --> 00:13:25.169
Davis, hi.

00:13:25.169 --> 00:13:26.169
How's you doing?

00:13:26.169 --> 00:13:28.169
Uh, she's got a clean bill of health.

00:13:28.169 --> 00:13:32.169
But, um, I just found out that she's a street kid.

00:13:32.169 --> 00:13:34.169
So, I was gonna drop her off.

00:13:34.169 --> 00:13:37.169
Drop her off at the city shelter tonight.

