00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:44.620
Okay. I'm gonna take my thin mince and head home.

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:47.620
I thought you might want a safe place to stay tonight, but...

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:49.620
But would I still be a free agent?

00:14:49.620 --> 00:14:54.769
As long as you promise to think about Davis's offer.

00:14:54.769 --> 00:15:03.029
offer.

