00:15:17.019 --> 00:15:21.019
Don't try to keep secrets from me, Clark. Test Mercer is a pit bull and prada.

00:15:21.019 --> 00:15:26.019
There's no way she'd roll out the welcome mat for a copy boy, no matter how charming his smile is.

