You have a charming smile?

00:15:27.019 --> 00:15:31.019
I think you're about to lose some teeth if you don't tell me what she said.

00:15:31.019 --> 00:15:33.019
Lois, you sound like a jealous girlfriend.

00:15:33.019 --> 00:15:34.019
Jealous.

00:15:34.019 --> 00:15:35.019
Have you?

00:15:35.019 --> 00:15:36.019
Please.

00:15:36.019 --> 00:15:38.019
That would be like Willie Mays being jealous.

00:15:38.019 --> 00:15:40.019
