Hi. Lois Lane, Daily Planet.

00:15:50.299 --> 00:15:51.299
Care to show me around?

00:15:51.299 --> 00:15:52.299
No press allowed.

00:15:52.299 --> 00:16:00.000
Swing and a mess?

