00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:20.500
Sorry, no. No one's allowed in?

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:22.500
What's your name, Officer?

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:23.500
Officer.

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:26.549
Double check?

00:16:26.549 --> 00:16:28.549
You've got to be a mistake.

00:16:28.549 --> 00:16:29.549
No mistake, sir.

00:16:29.549 --> 00:16:32.549
We haven't found one shred of exposing material.

00:16:32.549 --> 00:16:33.549
There's no residue.

00:16:33.549 --> 00:16:34.549
There's no detonator.

00:16:34.549 --> 00:16:35.549
There's nothing.

00:16:35.549 --> 00:16:36.549
There's no bomb on this bus.

00:16:36.549 --> 00:16:38.549
Wake up, Smallville.

00:16:38.549 --> 00:16:40.549
That cop's about as stiff as a starched uniform.

00:16:40.549 --> 00:16:41.549
Let's move on.

00:16:41.549 --> 00:16:43.549
Lois, I just heard there was no bomb.

00:16:43.549 --> 00:16:50.029
That doesn't look like the engine overheating.

00:16:50.029 --> 00:16:53.029
Look, we need to talk to somebody who's on the bus.

00:16:53.029 --> 00:16:55.029
Chloe called.

00:16:55.029 --> 00:16:56.029
