00:16:56.029 --> 00:16:59.029
Maybe you could ask her what she saw, and I'll track down the others.

00:16:59.029 --> 00:17:00.029
The thing is not so good.

00:17:00.029 --> 00:17:03.029
with the kids. Why don't you take a little Laura for Nanny and I'll do the rest.

