What's up?

00:17:30.710 --> 00:17:32.710
Wait, I remember you. You helped me get off the bus.

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:34.710
Yeah, I'm glad you're okay, Matt.

00:17:34.710 --> 00:17:37.710
Do you mind if I ask you a few questions?

00:17:37.710 --> 00:17:40.710
Did you see anything before the blast?

00:17:40.710 --> 00:17:43.710
Anything unusual? Anything strange?

00:17:43.710 --> 00:17:44.710
